const correctButtonLabels=()=>{const t=ui[q("language").value]||ui.en;["addCourse","start","samplePolicy","clearPolicy","decide","checkAnother","copy","openEmail"].forEach((id,i)=>q(id).textContent=t.buttons[i])};correctButtonLabels();q("language").addEventListener("change",correctButtonLabels);
const courseFormText={en:["Course name","Example: BIO 101","Add","Cancel"],fa:["نام درس","مثلاً BIO 101","افزودن","لغو"],es:["Nombre del curso","Ejemplo: BIO 101","Añadir","Cancelar"],ar:["اسم المقرر","مثال: BIO 101","إضافة","إلغاء"],fr:["Nom du cours","Exemple : BIO 101","Ajouter","Annuler"],de:["Kursname","Beispiel: BIO 101","Hinzufügen","Abbrechen"],zh:["课程名称","例如：BIO 101","添加","取消"],hi:["पाठ्यक्रम का नाम","उदाहरण: BIO 101","जोड़ें","रद्द करें"],tr:["Ders adı","Örnek: BIO 101","Ekle","İptal"],ur:["کورس کا نام","مثال: BIO 101","شامل کریں","منسوخ"]};function translateCourseForm(){const a=courseFormText[q("language").value]||courseFormText.en;document.querySelector("#addCourseForm label").textContent=a[0];q("newCourseName").placeholder=a[1];q("saveCourseName").textContent=a[2];q("cancelCourseName").textContent=a[3]}function closeCourseForm(){q("addCourseForm").classList.add("hidden");q("addCourse").setAttribute("aria-expanded","false");q("newCourseName").value=""}q("addCourse").setAttribute("aria-expanded","false");q("addCourse").onclick=()=>{const form=q("addCourseForm"),open=form.classList.toggle("hidden");q("addCourse").setAttribute("aria-expanded",String(!open));if(!open)q("newCourseName").focus()};q("cancelCourseName").onclick=closeCourseForm;q("addCourseForm").onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();const name=q("newCourseName").value.trim();if(!name){q("newCourseName").focus();return}if(!courses.includes(name))courses.push(name);saveCourse();activeCourse=name;localStorage.setItem("aipc_courses",JSON.stringify(courses));localStorage.setItem("aipc_active",name);renderCourses();loadCourse();closeCourseForm()};translateCourseForm();q("language").addEventListener("change",translateCourseForm);
